{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic"],"declarations":31,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.pure_bar_even_at_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.pure_bar_even_at_star","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L166-L171","doc":"**`q*` is the pure-bar-even point (capstone `ε = 0`).** The full carrier is\nbar-fixed at the self-dual locus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.oddVanishAtStar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.oddVanishAtStar","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L164-L164","doc":"**content:** the odd part vanishes at the locus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.qStar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.qStar","kind":"def","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L162-L162","doc":"the self-dual locus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.oddBarOdd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.oddBarOdd","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L160-L160","doc":"**content:** the odd part is bar-odd. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.evenBarFixed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.evenBarFixed","kind":"theorem","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L158-L158","doc":"**content:** the even part is bar-fixed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.decomp","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L156-L156","doc":"**content:** the decomposition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.odd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.odd","kind":"def","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L154-L154","doc":"its bar-odd part (`Im 𝔙` / decay-sinh channel). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.even","kind":"def","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L152-L152","doc":"its bar-even part (`Re 𝔙` / meson-cosh channel). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.S","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.S","kind":"def","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L150-L150","doc":"the full carrier `S = Q_β/E₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier.mk","kind":"ctor","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L148-L148","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarDecomposedCarrier","kind":"structure","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L146-L164","doc":"The full c₃ carrier `S`, bar-decomposed, with a bar-odd part vanishing at the\nself-dual locus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.toTarget","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.toTarget","kind":"def","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L130-L137","doc":"A simple-zero carrier refines the plain `BarOddCarrierTarget`: it forgets the\nfactorization and keeps the (now-derived) vanishing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.simpleZero_vanishAtStar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.simpleZero_vanishAtStar","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L125-L128","doc":"A simple-zero carrier **vanishes at the locus** — derived from the\nfactorization, not assumed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.cofactorNeZero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.cofactorNeZero","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L123-L123","doc":"**content:** the cofactor is a unit at the locus — the zero is *simple*\n(the algebraic \"slope ≠ 0\"). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.factor","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L120-L120","doc":"**content:** the simple-zero factorization. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.cofactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.cofactor","kind":"def","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L118-L118","doc":"the cofactor exhibiting the linear factor `(x − qStar)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.qStar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.qStar","kind":"def","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L116-L116","doc":"the self-dual locus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.barOdd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.barOdd","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L114-L114","doc":"**content:** bar-odd parity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.N","kind":"def","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L112-L112","doc":"the bar-odd carrier. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier.mk","kind":"ctor","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L110-L110","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.SimpleZeroBarOddCarrier","kind":"structure","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L108-L123","doc":"A bar-odd carrier with a **simple** zero at the self-dual locus, encoded\nalgebraically: `N x = (x − qStar) · cofactor x` with `cofactor qStar ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.trivial_carrier_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.trivial_carrier_zero","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L94-L97","doc":"The trivial inhabitant is genuinely content-free: its carrier is identically\nzero. This is the machine-checked witness that the interface does not constrain\nthe physics. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.trivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.trivial","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L80-L92","doc":"**Honesty check — the interface is trivially inhabitable.** The `N ≡ 0`\ncarrier satisfies every field (bar-odd vacuously, vanishing everywhere), so\n`BarOddCarrierTarget` *alone* carries no content: the wall is NOT the interface,\nthe parity, or the vanishing condition (all free). It is EXCLUSIVELY (a) the\nfibre/functorial provenance that produces the *specific* non-zero `N` of the c₃\nodd channel, and (b) the sub-`Q_β`-floor *value* of `qStar`, which\n`no_anchor_invariant_realizes_swing` + `MeasurementLimitedFloor` prove is not\nderivable. Mirrors `TauFunctorTargetSpec.interface_alone_is_trivially_inhabitable`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.even_symmetrization_at_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.even_symmetrization_at_star","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L71-L78","doc":"**A bar-odd carrier is antisymmetric about any bar-fixed point in value.**\nIf `T.N x = 0` then `σ (T.N x) = 0` too; more usefully, at the locus the odd\ncarrier contributes nothing to the bar-even (`Re 𝔙`) channel — the value there is\ncarried entirely by the even part. Stated as the vanishing of the symmetrized\ncombination `N + σ∘N` at `qStar`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.bar_vanishes_at_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.bar_vanishes_at_star","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L66-L69","doc":"**Self-consistency at the locus.** The bar image of the carrier also vanishes\nat `qStar` — the zero is bar-fixed, matching \"pure bar-even at `q*`\" (capstone). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget.vanishAtStar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget.vanishAtStar","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L62-L62","doc":"**content:** the carrier vanishes at the self-dual locus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget.qStar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget.qStar","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L60-L60","doc":"the self-dual locus (the `ε = 0` / CS→0 point). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget.barOdd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget.barOdd","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L58-L58","doc":"**content:** `N` is bar-odd — `σ (N x) = −N x` for every `x`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget.N","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L56-L56","doc":"the bar-odd carrier (the categorical image of the c₃ odd channel). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget.mk","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.BarOddCarrierTarget","kind":"structure","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/SelfDualLocusTargetSpec.lean#L49-L62","doc":"**The SHAPE target a fibre derivation of the c₃ bar-odd channel must supply.**\nA carrier `N : R → R` that is bar-odd under the substrate involution `σ`, together\nwith a self-dual locus `qStar` at which it vanishes (the `ε = 0` / CS-vanishing\npoint). The *functorial/fibre provenance* of `N`, and the sub-`Q_β`-floor *value*\nof `qStar`, live OUTSIDE this type — see the module docstring's two-leg split. ","signatureChunk":0}]}